== r3.89 (C1): Get(C) reads the next character exactly, a space and a line
== end included, in UTF-8; EndOfInput is true when nothing is left. GetLn(C)
== reads one character and the rest of its line, unless it was the line end.
Main :
    First Char := ' '
    GetLn(First)
    PutLn("first: ", First)
    C Char := ' '
    Count Integer := 0
    while not EndOfInput
        Get(C)
        Count += 1
        if C = '\n'
            PutLn("|")
        else
            Put("[", C, "]")
        ;
    ;
    PutLn(Count, " characters, end: ", EndOfInput)
;
